# PHP Standards (WordPress)

## WordPress Coding Standards

Follow the official [WordPress PHP Coding Standards](https://developer.wordpress.org/coding-standards/wordpress-coding-standards/php/).

## Naming Conventions

### Functions
```php
// ✅ Correct - Lowercase with underscores, prefixed with theme name
function skeleton_get_custom_logo() { }
function skeleton_register_sidebars() { }
function skeleton_enqueue_scripts() { }
function skeleton_setup_theme() { }

// ❌ Wrong - camelCase or unprefixed
function getCustomLogo() { }
function register_sidebars() { }
```

### Classes
```php
// ✅ Correct - Capitalized words with underscores, prefixed
class Skeleton_Custom_Walker extends Walker_Nav_Menu { }
class Skeleton_Theme_Setup { }
class Skeleton_Widget_Recent_Posts extends WP_Widget { }

// ❌ Wrong
class customWalker { }
class ThemeSetup { }
```

### Constants
```php
// ✅ Correct - Uppercase with underscores
define( 'SKELETON_VERSION', '1.0.0' );
define( 'SKELETON_DIR', get_template_directory() );
define( 'SKELETON_URI', get_template_directory_uri() );

// ❌ Wrong
define( 'skeletonVersion', '1.0.0' );
define( 'themeDir', get_template_directory() );
```

### Variables
```php
// ✅ Correct - Lowercase with underscores
$post_id = get_the_ID();
$custom_field = get_post_meta( $post_id, '_custom_field', true );
$menu_items = wp_get_nav_menu_items( 'primary' );

// ❌ Wrong - camelCase
$postId = get_the_ID();
$customField = get_post_meta( $postId, '_custom_field', true );
```

### Files
```php
// ✅ Correct - Lowercase with hyphens
template-parts/content-single.php
inc/template-functions.php
inc/customizer-settings.php

// ❌ Wrong
templateParts/contentSingle.php
inc/templateFunctions.php
```

## Spacing & Formatting

### Spaces Inside Parentheses
```php
// ✅ Correct - Spaces after opening and before closing
if ( $condition ) { }
foreach ( $items as $item ) { }
while ( have_posts() ) { }
function_call( $arg1, $arg2 );
array( 'key' => 'value' );

// ❌ Wrong - No spaces
if ($condition) { }
foreach ($items as $item) { }
function_call($arg1, $arg2);
```

### Spaces Around Operators
```php
// ✅ Correct
$result = $a + $b;
$is_valid = $value === true;
$full_name = $first_name . ' ' . $last_name;

// ❌ Wrong
$result=$a+$b;
$is_valid=$value===true;
```

### Array Syntax
```php
// ✅ Correct - Long syntax with trailing comma
$array = array(
    'key1' => 'value1',
    'key2' => 'value2',
    'key3' => 'value3',
);

// ✅ Also acceptable - Short syntax (PHP 5.4+)
$array = [
    'key1' => 'value1',
    'key2' => 'value2',
    'key3' => 'value3',
];

// ❌ Wrong - No trailing comma, inconsistent spacing
$array = array('key1'=>'value1','key2'=>'value2');
```

### Indentation
```php
// ✅ Correct - Use TABS, not spaces
function skeleton_example() {
	$variable = 'value';

	if ( $condition ) {
		// Indented with tab
		do_something();
	}
}
```

### Braces
```php
// ✅ Correct - Opening brace on same line
if ( $condition ) {
    // code
} elseif ( $other_condition ) {
    // code
} else {
    // code
}

// ✅ Correct - Functions and classes
function skeleton_function_name() {
    // code
}

class Skeleton_Class_Name {
    // code
}
```

## Escaping Output

### ALWAYS Escape Output
```php
// Text content
echo esc_html( $text );
<?php echo esc_html( $variable ); ?>

// HTML attributes
<div class="<?php echo esc_attr( $class ); ?>">
<a href="<?php echo esc_url( $url ); ?>">

// JavaScript data
<script>var data = <?php echo wp_json_encode( $data ); ?>;</script>

// HTML content (allows safe HTML)
echo wp_kses_post( $html_content );

// Translation with escaping
echo esc_html__( 'Text to translate', 'skeleton' );
echo esc_attr__( 'Attribute text', 'skeleton' );
esc_html_e( 'Text to echo', 'skeleton' );
```

### Escaping Functions Reference
```php
esc_html()     // Escape for HTML text content
esc_attr()     // Escape for HTML attributes
esc_url()      // Escape URLs
esc_js()       // Escape for inline JavaScript
esc_textarea() // Escape for textarea content
wp_kses()      // Allow specific HTML tags
wp_kses_post() // Allow HTML tags valid in post content
```

## Sanitizing Input

### ALWAYS Sanitize Input
```php
// Text fields
$clean_text = sanitize_text_field( $_POST['field'] );

// Email
$clean_email = sanitize_email( $_POST['email'] );

// URL
$clean_url = esc_url_raw( $_POST['url'] );

// Integer
$clean_int = absint( $_GET['id'] );
$clean_int = intval( $_GET['id'] );

// Textarea
$clean_textarea = sanitize_textarea_field( $_POST['message'] );

// File name
$clean_filename = sanitize_file_name( $_FILES['file']['name'] );

// HTML content
$clean_html = wp_kses_post( $_POST['content'] );
```

## Nonces & Security

### Form Nonces
```php
// Create nonce field in form
wp_nonce_field( 'skeleton_action', 'skeleton_nonce' );

// Verify nonce on submission
if ( ! isset( $_POST['skeleton_nonce'] ) ||
     ! wp_verify_nonce( $_POST['skeleton_nonce'], 'skeleton_action' ) ) {
    wp_die( esc_html__( 'Security check failed.', 'skeleton' ) );
}
```

### AJAX Nonces
```php
// Create nonce for AJAX
$nonce = wp_create_nonce( 'skeleton_ajax_nonce' );

// Verify in AJAX handler
check_ajax_referer( 'skeleton_ajax_nonce', 'nonce' );
```

### Capability Checks
```php
// Check user capabilities
if ( ! current_user_can( 'edit_posts' ) ) {
    wp_die( esc_html__( 'You do not have permission.', 'skeleton' ) );
}
```

## Internationalization (i18n)

### Text Domain
```php
// Always use 'skeleton' as text domain
__( 'Text', 'skeleton' )
_e( 'Text', 'skeleton' )
esc_html__( 'Text', 'skeleton' )
esc_html_e( 'Text', 'skeleton' )
```

### Translation Functions
```php
// Return translated string
$text = __( 'Hello World', 'skeleton' );

// Echo translated string
_e( 'Hello World', 'skeleton' );

// With escaping (preferred)
echo esc_html__( 'Hello World', 'skeleton' );
esc_html_e( 'Hello World', 'skeleton' );

// Placeholders
printf(
    /* translators: %s: User name */
    esc_html__( 'Hello, %s!', 'skeleton' ),
    esc_html( $user_name )
);

// Plural forms
printf(
    /* translators: %d: Number of items */
    esc_html( _n( '%d item', '%d items', $count, 'skeleton' ) ),
    $count
);
```

## Template Structure

### The Loop
```php
<?php if ( have_posts() ) : ?>
    <?php while ( have_posts() ) : the_post(); ?>
        <article <?php post_class(); ?>>
            <header class="entry-header">
                <?php the_title( '<h2 class="entry-title">', '</h2>' ); ?>
            </header>

            <div class="entry-content">
                <?php the_content(); ?>
            </div>
        </article>
    <?php endwhile; ?>

    <?php the_posts_pagination(); ?>

<?php else : ?>
    <p><?php esc_html_e( 'No posts found.', 'skeleton' ); ?></p>
<?php endif; ?>
```

### Template Parts
```php
// Load template part
get_template_part( 'template-parts/content', get_post_type() );

// With arguments (WordPress 5.5+)
get_template_part( 'template-parts/card', 'product', array(
    'product_id' => $product_id,
    'show_price' => true,
) );

// In template part, access args
$product_id = $args['product_id'] ?? 0;
$show_price = $args['show_price'] ?? false;
```

### Header & Footer
```php
// header.php
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html <?php language_attributes(); ?>>
<head>
    <meta charset="<?php bloginfo( 'charset' ); ?>">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <?php wp_head(); ?>
</head>
<body <?php body_class(); ?>>
<?php wp_body_open(); ?>

// footer.php
<?php wp_footer(); ?>
</body>
</html>
```

## Functions.php Structure

### Organized Setup
```php
<?php
/**
 * Theme functions and definitions
 *
 * @package Skeleton
 */

// Define constants
define( 'SKELETON_VERSION', '1.0.0' );
define( 'SKELETON_DIR', get_template_directory() );
define( 'SKELETON_URI', get_template_directory_uri() );

// Include files
require SKELETON_DIR . '/inc/setup.php';
require SKELETON_DIR . '/inc/enqueue.php';
require SKELETON_DIR . '/inc/template-functions.php';
require SKELETON_DIR . '/inc/template-tags.php';

// Optional includes
if ( is_admin() ) {
    require SKELETON_DIR . '/inc/admin.php';
}

if ( class_exists( 'WooCommerce' ) ) {
    require SKELETON_DIR . '/inc/woocommerce.php';
}
```

### Theme Setup
```php
// inc/setup.php
<?php
/**
 * Theme setup
 *
 * @package Skeleton
 */

if ( ! function_exists( 'skeleton_setup' ) ) {
    /**
     * Sets up theme defaults and registers support for various WordPress features.
     */
    function skeleton_setup() {
        // Add theme support
        add_theme_support( 'title-tag' );
        add_theme_support( 'post-thumbnails' );
        add_theme_support( 'html5', array(
            'search-form',
            'comment-form',
            'comment-list',
            'gallery',
            'caption',
            'style',
            'script',
        ) );

        // Register nav menus
        register_nav_menus( array(
            'primary' => esc_html__( 'Primary Menu', 'skeleton' ),
            'footer'  => esc_html__( 'Footer Menu', 'skeleton' ),
        ) );

        // Set content width
        $GLOBALS['content_width'] = 1200;
    }
}
add_action( 'after_setup_theme', 'skeleton_setup' );
```

### Enqueue Scripts & Styles
```php
// inc/enqueue.php
<?php
/**
 * Enqueue scripts and styles
 *
 * @package Skeleton
 */

/**
 * Enqueue theme styles and scripts.
 */
function skeleton_enqueue_scripts() {
    // Styles
    wp_enqueue_style(
        'skeleton-style',
        get_stylesheet_uri(),
        array(),
        SKELETON_VERSION
    );

    wp_enqueue_style(
        'skeleton-main',
        SKELETON_URI . '/assets/css/main.css',
        array(),
        SKELETON_VERSION
    );

    // Scripts
    wp_enqueue_script(
        'skeleton-main',
        SKELETON_URI . '/assets/js/main.js',
        array(),
        SKELETON_VERSION,
        true // Load in footer
    );

    // Localize script
    wp_localize_script( 'skeleton-main', 'skeletonData', array(
        'ajaxUrl' => admin_url( 'admin-ajax.php' ),
        'nonce'   => wp_create_nonce( 'skeleton_nonce' ),
    ) );
}
add_action( 'wp_enqueue_scripts', 'skeleton_enqueue_scripts' );
```

## Common Anti-Patterns

### ❌ Never Do This
```php
// Direct output without escaping
echo $variable;
echo $_GET['param'];

// Using short PHP tags
<? echo $var; ?>
<?=$var?>

// Hardcoded URLs
<link href="/wp-content/themes/skeleton/style.css">

// Direct database queries without preparation
$wpdb->query( "SELECT * FROM table WHERE id = " . $_GET['id'] );

// Not using text domain
__( 'Hello' )

// Trusting user input
$file = $_GET['file'];
include( $file );
```

### ✅ Do This Instead
```php
// Always escape output
echo esc_html( $variable );
echo esc_attr( sanitize_text_field( $_GET['param'] ) );

// Use full PHP tags
<?php echo esc_html( $var ); ?>

// Use WordPress functions for URLs
<link href="<?php echo esc_url( get_stylesheet_uri() ); ?>">

// Use prepared statements
$wpdb->prepare( "SELECT * FROM table WHERE id = %d", absint( $_GET['id'] ) );

// Always use text domain
__( 'Hello', 'skeleton' )

// Validate and sanitize
$allowed_files = array( 'header', 'footer', 'sidebar' );
$file = sanitize_file_name( $_GET['file'] );
if ( in_array( $file, $allowed_files, true ) ) {
    include( SKELETON_DIR . '/parts/' . $file . '.php' );
}
```
